    "ハーツの早見表" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hearts Quick Reference"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ハートは、だれかが場に出すまで先頭に出せません（手札がハートだけなら出せます）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't lead a heart until one has been played (unless your hand is all hearts)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出せる札" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What You Can Play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "別のマークの札は、A でも勝てません。切り札はありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A card of a different suit can't win, even an Ace. There is no trump."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同じマークがあれば必ず出します。無ければ、どの札でも出せます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you have the suit that was led, you must play it. If not, you can play any card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "弱い" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
