          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "High"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "強い順に A K Q J 10 9 8 7 6 5 4 3 2" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Highest to lowest: A K Q J 10 9 8 7 6 5 4 3 2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "強さを比べるのは同じマークの中だけ。マークどうしに強い・弱いはありません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only cards of the same suit are compared. No suit is stronger than another."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最初に出たマークと同じマークのうち、いちばん強い札を出した人が 4 枚を取ります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever plays the highest card of the suit that was led takes all 4 cards."
